unt":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qku"}]},{"client_msg_id":"82fdb30f-8e94-4e4e-9d7a-7b85fa5a4656","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"一方、Cライブラリの移植とかだとほんと大変...","ts":"1636269896.348000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZFXDI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3116b9fd-228d-48c2-8d16-ebdb3262b229","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"wrapper の数が少ないと書いちゃうのが早いすね。","ts":"1636269861.347000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hai-small","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"S6u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a4d34efa-0921-4eb2-a12b-b49ad6292f4a","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"union扱うのがめんどい問題とかもCに関数書くのが結局一番楽だったしそういうもんかも","ts":"1636269746.346300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mzo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4dc91621-b21b-4c88-9a73-657cc2e2633f","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"```static void JS_SetOpaque_uintptr(JSValue obj, uintptr_t opaque)\n{\n  JS_SetOpaque(obj, (void *)(opaque));\n}```\nこれで通しちゃいました","ts":"1636269426.345800","edited":{"user":"UKHUVMBJR","ts":"1636269707.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f0P0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f9ef283d-945e-44a5-9401-152e41299b81","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"なんとなくそれが原因でCにラッパ作るのが正攻法な気がしてきました","ts":"1636269165.345100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H7IZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"96cf5e9b-1d2c-47db-994f-90819e3c0374","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"自分なら C の static 関数かいて uintptr_t 受けるだけのラッパーにするかな…","ts":"1636269124.344600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yOYoj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4bde00c8-8d03-47f5-a923-048cc4091b15","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"`void*` は unsafe.Pointer を直接渡すのはあるけど cgo.Handle を渡すことは想定されていないように見えますね","ts":"1636269104.344100","edited":{"user":"UERCTTT8B","ts":"1636269145.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cJQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"18e9bc57-ced1-49f7-82a6-fbc5c1fe536d","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"うーん、型変換が通るコード試すとどれも `possible misuse of unsafe.Pointer` 言われてしまいますね\ncgo.Handleが絡むと不可避だったりするのかなあ","ts":"1636269043.343600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C+E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"284f14a3-11d5-4d6a-ac55-349442ccbec1","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"`unsafe.Pointer(uintptr(cgo.NewHandle(p)))` だと `possible misuse` と言われました・・・\nこれは実際には問題ない警告でしょうか?","ts":"1636268683.342900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6yP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9f692d8a-ac51-4b52-9692-31aa09343f1c","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"unsafe.Pointer(uintptr(p))","ts":"1636268515.341900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tIL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cfddcaa7-54a3-4df4-98d2-2bdd9277be9b","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"1度 uintptr でキャストすると行けると思います。","ts":"1636268487.341100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OhRip"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7059fbdc-0de5-4ade-92ba-96dbc0ff86ce","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"コンパイラの気持ちになるのつらい","ts":"1636268301.340500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g7g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aaca3d2d-abb0-480e-99c4-058c78bbb018","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"CとGoのそれぞれのメモリ表現を考えながら脳内型変換しなきゃないのでたいへん","ts":"1636268258.340200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3EL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1b2d8e3d-2969-49ff-8864-bea017b5393b","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"cgo 難しい","ts":"1636268173.339600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["UKHUVMBJR","U01AQ5BFNLX"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"84pN9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75178e06-a8ae-43bf-8881-890fed3ec493","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"（しつもん）\n`void*` を要求されてるC関数に `cgo.Handle` を渡すにはどうすればよいですか？\nドキュメントだと `uintptr_t` に `cgo.Handle` を渡す例しかなかったので。\n\u003chttps://pkg.go.dev/runtime/cgo#Handle.Value\u003e\n\n`(*C.void)(cgo.NewHandle(p))` ではだめでした。\n`unsafe.Pointer(cgo.NewHandle(p))` だと通るけど警告 `possible misuse of unsafe.Pointer` が出てますが何が問題か微妙に分からず。\n(uintptrとunsafe.Pointerの間でGCが走る余地を作っちゃダメなのでそれ関係?)","ts":"1636267547.339100","attachments":[{"fallback":"cgo package - runtime/cgo - pkg.go.dev","id":1,"title":"cgo package - runtime/cgo - pkg.go.dev","title_link":"https://pkg.go.dev/runtime/cgo#Handle.Value","text":"Package cgo contains runtime support for code generated by the cgo tool.","blocks":null,"service_name":"pkg.go.dev","service_icon":"https://pkg.go.dev/static/shared/icon/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://pkg.go.dev/runtime/cgo#Handle.Value","original_url":"https://pkg.go.dev/runtime/cgo#Handle.Value"}],"edited":{"user":"UKHUVMBJR","ts":"1636268171.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2XHkD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"100f44e1-fbda-4a0a-8250-77b91c71fa75","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"ううっこれは微妙だった","ts":"1636215733.337900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yfF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a0a79fc-b1b9-4999-8a73-4c7f35024513","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/golang/go/issues/49415\u003e","ts":"1636213763.337500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d=ICh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fd443275-f7fe-4fe8-be1e-d8c7a514c04a","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Go のランタイム (テスト) バグめっけ","ts":"1636213499.337300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sayv="}]}]
